    "name": "SOULHOT",
    "steam_appid": 2106930,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106930/extras/5c8c818931e6cbbbe6472f912a7453c3.poster.avif?t=1752148952\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106930/extras/5c8c818931e6cbbbe6472f912a7453c3.webm?t=1752148952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106930/extras/5c8c818931e6cbbbe6472f912a7453c3.mp4?t=1752148952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SOULHOT</strong> is a high-octane action game that blends parkour and FPS elements, putting you in the shoes of a relentless individual who refuses to bow to a corrupt system. He will stop at nothing to bring it down.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Soulhot </strong>is a physics-driven adventure set in a mysterious dystopia. You hold a personal vendetta against the Zen Corporation \u2014 a force that controls the world and has driven humanity into starvation. You\u2019ve infiltrated their towering headquarters, completely alone. To survive, you'll need to rely solely on your weapon skills and intelligence. Good luck!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MASTER THE PHYSICS SYSTEM</h2>Every object and weapon within the Zen skyscraper operates under an advanced physics system. Be creative, manipulate your environment, and find clever ways to traverse between floors.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106930/extras/758a3d9b3cc96f7c9c8d12e7c7d35856.poster.avif?t=1752148952\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106930/extras/758a3d9b3cc96f7c9c8d12e7c7d35856.webm?t=1752148952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106930/extras/758a3d9b3cc96f7c9c8d12e7c7d35856.mp4?t=1752148952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEFEAT RUTHLESS SOLDIERS</h2>Each floor is guarded by elite forces equipped with heavy weaponry. Use the physics system to your advantage and outsmart your enemies with skill and ingenuity.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106930/extras/2d24ddb05f90f08fd5985955bfc8eeaa.poster.avif?t=1752148952\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106930/extras/2d24ddb05f90f08fd5985955bfc8eeaa.webm?t=1752148952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106930/extras/2d24ddb05f90f08fd5985955bfc8eeaa.mp4?t=1752148952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UNCOVER THE MYSTERIES</h2>You've made it deep into Zen Corporation\u2019s headquarters. Now, you're completely on your own. Each floor reveals new experiments, hidden secrets, and psychological challenges. Are you ready to face the truth?</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106930/extras/5c8c818931e6cbbbe6472f912a7453c3.poster.avif?t=1752148952\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106930/extras/5c8c818931e6cbbbe6472f912a7453c3.webm?t=1752148952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106930/extras/5c8c818931e6cbbbe6472f912a7453c3.mp4?t=1752148952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>SOULHOT</strong> is a high-octane action game that blends parkour and FPS elements, putting you in the shoes of a relentless individual who refuses to bow to a corrupt system. He will stop at nothing to bring it down.</p><br><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Soulhot </strong>is a physics-driven adventure set in a mysterious dystopia. You hold a personal vendetta against the Zen Corporation \u2014 a force that controls the world and has driven humanity into starvation. You\u2019ve infiltrated their towering headquarters, completely alone. To survive, you'll need to rely solely on your weapon skills and intelligence. Good luck!</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">MASTER THE PHYSICS SYSTEM</h2>Every object and weapon within the Zen skyscraper operates under an advanced physics system. Be creative, manipulate your environment, and find clever ways to traverse between floors.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106930/extras/758a3d9b3cc96f7c9c8d12e7c7d35856.poster.avif?t=1752148952\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106930/extras/758a3d9b3cc96f7c9c8d12e7c7d35856.webm?t=1752148952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106930/extras/758a3d9b3cc96f7c9c8d12e7c7d35856.mp4?t=1752148952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">DEFEAT RUTHLESS SOLDIERS</h2>Each floor is guarded by elite forces equipped with heavy weaponry. Use the physics system to your advantage and outsmart your enemies with skill and ingenuity.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106930/extras/2d24ddb05f90f08fd5985955bfc8eeaa.poster.avif?t=1752148952\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106930/extras/2d24ddb05f90f08fd5985955bfc8eeaa.webm?t=1752148952\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2106930/extras/2d24ddb05f90f08fd5985955bfc8eeaa.mp4?t=1752148952\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">UNCOVER THE MYSTERIES</h2>You've made it deep into Zen Corporation\u2019s headquarters. Now, you're completely on your own. Each floor reveals new experiments, hidden secrets, and psychological challenges. Are you ready to face the truth?</p></li></ul>",
